      "f": "Hard disk drive",
      "g": "A1.1",
      "ib": "A magnetic secondary storage device that stores data on rotating platters, which are read and written by moving read/write heads.",
      "q": "Outline one advantage and one disadvantage of an HDD compared with an SSD. [2]",
      "a": [
        "Advantage: lower cost per gigabyte, so large capacities are cheap;",
        "Disadvantage: slower access because of moving parts, and more easily damaged if dropped."
      ],
      "h": 0,
      "p": "A1-hardware",
