      "q": "Explain why a smartphone may include an NPU. [2]",
      "a": [
        "An NPU is designed specifically for neural network calculations, so it runs ML models faster and uses less power than the CPU;",
        "allowing features such as face unlock and voice recognition to run on the device quickly, offline and without sending personal data to the cloud."
      ],
      "h": 0,
      "p": "A4-machine-learning",
