      "q": "Describe filter, wrapper and embedded methods of feature selection. [3]",
      "a": [
        "Filter methods score each feature with a statistical test (e.g. correlation with the target) before and independently of training, and keep the best;",
        "wrapper methods train the model on different subsets of features and keep the subset that performs best;",
        "embedded methods select features during training itself, e.g. a decision tree’s feature importance or regularisation shrinking unhelpful weights to zero."
      ],
      "h": 1,
