      "q": "Describe a situation that could lead to deadlock.",
      "a": [
        "Process A holds resource 1 (e.g. a file) and requests resource 2 (e.g. a printer);",
        "while process B holds resource 2 and requests resource 1, so each waits for the other forever."
      ],
      "c": "Describe",
      "id": "6064d532e",
      "u": "B2",
      "n": "B2-control.sequence",
      "f": "proces|deadlock|forever"
