      "s": "search",
      "h": 0,
      "m": 2,
      "q": "Explain why binary search cannot be used on an unsorted list.",
      "a": [
        "Binary search decides which half to discard by comparing the target with the middle element;",
        "this only works if the list is sorted, because otherwise the target could be in the discarded half."
      ],
      "c": "Explain",
