      "q": "Distinguish between a static variable and an instance variable.",
      "a": [
        "A static variable belongs to the class, so there is only one copy, shared by all objects;",
        "whereas each object has its own separate copy of an instance variable, with its own value."
      ],
      "c": "Distinguish",
