      "p": "Case-study",
      "s": "hybrid",
      "h": 1,
      "m": 3,
      "q": "Describe a flow-based generative model.",
      "a": [
        "It learns a chain of invertible (reversible) transformations;",
        "that map random noise exactly to realistic images;",
        "and can map any image back to its noise, allowing exact likelihoods and traceable generation."
      ],
      "g": "hyb",
      "c": "Describe",
