      "p": "Case-study",
      "s": "evaluate",
      "h": 0,
      "m": 3,
      "q": "Explain what is meant by training stability and why some models produce repetitive outputs.",
      "a": [
        "Training stability is how reliably a model trains to a good result;",
        "unstable models, such as GANs, can oscillate or collapse;",
        "producing a narrow set of repeated images (mode collapse) instead of the full variety of the data."
      ],
      "g": "eval",
