      "q": "Outline how horizontal partitioning improves scalability.",
      "a": [
        "The rows of a table are divided between several nodes, e.g. by customer region;",
        "so each node stores and handles only its share, and more nodes can be added as the data grows."
      ],
      "t": "partitioning",
