      "p": "A4-data",
      "s": "cleaning",
      "h": 1,
      "m": 2,
      "q": "Distinguish between normalisation and standardisation.",
      "a": [
        "Normalisation (min-max scaling) rescales values to a fixed range such as 0 to 1, using the minimum and maximum;",
        "standardisation rescales them to have a mean of 0 and a standard deviation of 1, using the mean and standard deviation."
      ],
      "t": "standardisation",
      "c": "Distinguish",
      "id": "4ed039910",
