      "p": "A4-models",
      "s": "metrics",
      "h": 1,
      "m": 4,
      "q": "Explain how overfitting can be detected and reduced.",
      "a": [
        "It is detected when accuracy on the training data is high but accuracy on separate validation or test data is much lower.",
        "It can be reduced by collecting more training data,",
        "simplifying the model (fewer features, a shallower tree, fewer layers) or using regularisation,",
        "and by stopping training early when validation performance stops improving."
      ],
      "t": "overfitting",
      "c": "Explain",
      "id": "619024086",
      "u": "A4",
      "n": "A4-models.metrics",
      "f": "Overfitting",
