      "s": "clustering",
      "h": 1,
      "m": 3,
      "q": "Explain how clustering can be used for customer segmentation.",
      "a": [
        "Customers are described by features such as annual spending, number of visits and age.",
        "A clustering algorithm such as k-means groups customers with similar features without being told the groups in advance.",
        "The business studies each cluster (e.g. “frequent low spenders”) and targets it with suitable offers."
      ],
      "t": "customer-segmentation",
