      "s": "patterns",
      "h": 1,
      "m": 2,
      "q": "Outline why design patterns are useful.",
      "a": [
        "They are proven solutions to problems that recur in many programs, so developers do not have to reinvent them;",
        "and they give developers a shared vocabulary, making designs easier to discuss and understand."
      ],
      "t": "design-pattern",
      "c": "Outline",
      "id": "c2256e705",
      "u": "B3",
      "n": "B3-advanced.patterns",
      "f": "design pattern",
